{"type":"data","nodes":[null,{"type":"data","data":[{"title":1,"excerpt":2,"tags":3,"film":7},"Il sol dell'avvenire (A Brighter Tomorrow)","Giovanni è un regista, Paola una produttrice. Giovanni gira un film ambientato nel 1956, scrive un film da Il nuotatore di Cheever e immagina un film con tante canzoni italiane. (Giovanni, a renowned Italian filmmaker, is about to start shooting a political film. But between his marriage in crisis, his co-producer on the verge of bankruptcy and the rapidly changing film industry, everything seems to be working against him! Always on the edge, Giovanni will have to rethink his way of doing things if he wants to lead his little world towards a bright tomorrow.)",[4,5,6],"artistic creation","marriage","may-december",{"type":8,"id":9,"slug":10,"title":11,"release":14,"filmType":18,"directors":19,"genre":36,"media":40,"synopsis":43,"production":46,"characters":52,"roles":80,"awards":138,"tags":3},"Film","IT2023_005","it2023-005-il-sol-dell-avvenire",{"native":12,"english":13},"Il sol dell'avvenire","A Brighter Tomorrow",{"type":15,"date":16,"year":17},"Theatrical release","2023-04-20",2023,"Fiction film",[20],{"id":21,"slug":22,"name":21,"birthYear":23,"deathYear":24,"gender":25,"nationality":26,"awards":27},"Nanni Moretti","nanni-moretti",1953,0,"Male identifying","Italy",[28,34],{"film":29,"year":30,"award":31,"category":32,"result":33},"it2015-012-mia-madre",2015,"Premio David di Donatello","Best Director","Nominated",{"film":29,"year":30,"award":31,"category":35,"result":33},"Best Supporting Actor",[37,38,39],"Metacinema","Drama","Comedy",{"posterUrl":41,"trailerUrl":42},"https://www.imdb.com/title/tt16731908/mediaviewer/rm3868011009/?ref_=tt_ov_i","https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=Tj2SzXLyADw",{"native":44,"english":45},"Giovanni è un regista, Paola una produttrice. Giovanni gira un film ambientato nel 1956, scrive un film da Il nuotatore di Cheever e immagina un film con tante canzoni italiane.","Giovanni, a renowned Italian fil